# Chat continuity file

`CHAT-CONTEXT.md` at the repo root is local-only (gitignored). It is the resume notes for this project.

On each calendar day work happens in chat:

- Read `CHAT-CONTEXT.md` before changing product direction.
- Update it the same day: correct the stable sections if behaviour changed, and append a short Daily log entry (decisions, what shipped, what is still open).
- Do not commit `CHAT-CONTEXT.md`.
- Do not paste secrets (API keys, service-role keys, passwords).
